raph\">A regular ticket costs only USD $35, thanks to our sponsors. It covers both conference days, lunch and refreshments, and the after party. Tickets are released in batches, so buying early secures your place and helps organizers plan for everyone who is coming. Contributor Day on April 9 has its own registration, which opens January 27, 2027. It is limited to 600 participants.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover wp-elements-2\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--edge-space);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--edge-space);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--edge-space);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--edge-space)\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-21922 size-large\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" data-object-position=\"65% 35%\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/wordpress.org/news/files/2026/11/image.png?resize=1024%2C683&#038;ssl=1\" style=\"object-position:65% 35%\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/wordpress.org/news/files/2026/11/image.png?resize=1024%2C683&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/wordpress.org/news/files/2026/11/image.png?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/wordpress.org/news/files/2026/11/image.png?resize=768%2C512&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/wordpress.org/news/files/2026/11/image.png?resize=1536%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/wordpress.org/news/files/2026/11/image.png?resize=2048%2C1366&amp;ssl=1 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-70 has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:#000073\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-cover-is-layout-a6a02316 wp-block-cover-is-layout-constrained\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color has-eb-garamond-font-family has-huge-font-size wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><strong>Join Asia’s Largest WordPress Gathering</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">April 9 – 11, 2027 | Penang Waterfront Convention Centre (PWCC), Penang, Malaysia</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-3e41869c wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-vivid-red-background-color has-background has-eb-garamond-font-family has-large-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https://asia.wordcamp.org/2027/tickets/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Get Your Event Pass</strong></a></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">None of this happens without sponsors. Their support keeps ticket prices low, backs the volunteers and contributors who make the event run, and helps WordCamp Asia stay true to the values of the WordPress project. In return, sponsors meet an engaged, international audience of developers, agencies, business owners, and creators.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Five packages are available, from a Small Business table to a Platinum booth, so there is a fit for local companies and global brands alike. Every sponsor also gets access to the Career Corner, a dedicated space for meeting and hiring WordPress professionals.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-7c6780e0 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgb(42,5,123) 0%,rgb(124,78,224) 100%);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--edge-space);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--edge-space);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--edge-space);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--edge-space)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-text-color is-content-justification-center is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-f56f9fcf wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"color:#00000000\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow aligncenter\" data-autoplay=\"true\" data-delay=\"3\" data-effect=\"slide\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:calc(1024 / 576)\"><div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_container swiper\"><ul class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_swiper-wrapper swiper-wrapper\"><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-21927\" data-aspect-ratio=\"1024 / 576\" data-id=\"21927\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/wordpress.org/news/files/2026/11/WCAsia-Sponsorship-Prospectus-01.png?resize=1024%2C576&#038;ssl=1\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/wordpress.org/news/files/2026/11/WCAsia-Sponsorship-Prospectus-01.png?resize=1024%2C576&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/wordpress.org/news/files/2026/11/WCAsia-Sponsorship-Prospectus-01.png?resize=768%2C432&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/wordpress.org/news/files/2026/11/WCAsia-Sponsorship-Prospectus-01.png?resize=300%2C169&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/wordpress.org/news/files/2026/11/WCAsia-Sponsorship-Prospectus-01.png?resize=1536%2C864&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/wordpress.org/news/files/2026/11/WCAsia-Sponsorship-Prospectus-01.png?w=2000&amp;ssl=1 2000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /></figure></li><li class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_slide swiper-slide\"><figure><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-block-jetpack-slideshow_image wp-image-21930\" data-aspect-ratio=\"1024 / 576\" data-id=\"21930\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/wordpress.org/news/files/2026/11/WCAsia-Sponsorship-Prospectus-02.png?resize=1024%2C576&#038;ssl=1\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/wordpress.org/news/files/2026/11/WCAsia-Sponsorship-Prospectus-02.png?